algorithms.pseudocode:
function DragonTurns(n):
    if n = 0: return []
    prev <- DragonTurns(n - 1)
    return prev ++ [R] ++ reverse_complement(prev)

Complexity: O(2^n) time and space

function EstimateBoxDim(path, scales):
    for eps in scales:
        N(eps) <- count occupied eps-boxes
    return linear regression slope of log(N) vs log(1/eps)

Complexity: O(|path| * |scales|)
